  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 15,000 gp (lesser), 30,000 gp (normal), 60,000 gp (greater)<br>\n<strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.; <strong>Feat Cost</strong> 3 sp</p>\n<p>You can alter a burst, emanation, or spread-shaped spell to increase its area. Any numeric measurements of the spell’s area increase by 100%. Spells that do not have an area of one of these sorts are not affected by this feat. (Cones, lines, and spheres are emanations.)</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Widen Spell; <strong>Cost</strong> 7,500 gp (lesser), 15,000 gp (normal), 30,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic#toc63\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed profile: lesser tier; held slender rod; 15000 gp.</p><p>Apply only to burst, emanation or spread areas, increasing numeric area measurements by 100 percent. The source treats cones, lines and spheres as emanations. Other area shapes are unaffected. Apply as part of casting while held, to a sphere effect of CL seven or lower; spend one of three daily uses, waive only this feat's extra spell-point/casting-time cost, and use only one apparatus per casting.</p><p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic\">Shared metamagic apparatus rules</a>.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
